    description: Some("The Quiz Master has stolen the six crystals of knowledge from Capcom World, and you cross six grid-map worlds to win them back. Instead of rolling dice you pick a numbered ball, answer the multiple-choice question that follows, and advance that many squares when you get it right. Wrong answers cost a life; each world\'s bosses come from the Capcom game it is themed on."),
